Cloudflare Clef-flash
---------------------

The text record encoder and joint schema head are adapted from Cloudflare's
joint_schema_model.py at revision 8b2e5fd17c09fd49bc2880b805d5323ec7ff4ff3.
The source code and model weights are distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Kevala implements the text encoder and head in Rust and uses its
Qwen3.5 backbone for native, WebAssembly, and WebGPU execution.

https://huggingface.co/Cloudflare/clef-flash
